            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shela yaali mulala ku vayaayi va Yuda. Ivisukulurwi vivie viali harara na Eri uwatangiza lidaala lia Leka; Laada yatangiza lidaala lia Maresha; ihiiri yu uvunavi vwi katani, avamenyaa mu lidaala lia Bezu Ashibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokimu na avandu vamenya mu lidaala lia Kozeba; Joashi na Sarafu, valeta vakali kutura mu kivala cha Moabu, na vaadikira mu kivala cha Bezelehemu. Yaga gaveeye gi zing'inga zia kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yava vaali avaloongi mu litumika liu mwami na vamenya mu madaala ga Netaimu na Gedera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Visukululwi via Simioni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simioni yaali na vayaayi vatano: Nemueli, Jamini, Jaribu, Zera na Shauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shauli yaali nu muyaayi mulala walangwa Shalumu, yaali kandi nu mwisukulu walangwa Mibusamu, harara ni kisukururwi kialangwa Mishima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mishima yaali na vayaayi vavaga: Hamueli, Zakuri na Shimei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimei yaali na avayaayi 16 na avakaana 6, navuzwa avamwavo veve si vaali na avana vanyingi mba; kunangwa ihiiri ya Simioni si yamedeka ligali kuli ihiiri ya Yuda yameda kuviruka mba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuduuka ku ing'inga yi liamiiha liu mwami Daudi, ivisukulurwi via Simioni viamenya mu madaala yaga: Beerisheba, Molada, Hazarishuali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biliha, Ezemu, Toladi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bezueli, Horima, Zikilaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bezu Marikabozu, Hazarisusimu, Bezubiri, na Shaaraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi vamenya mu madaala gandi gatano: Etamu, Aini, Rimoni, Tokeni, na Ashani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi nu kutudaala twakumberiza amadara manene ga vamenya mu, kuduuka ku lidaala lia Baalazi. Yaga nigo amang'oda gang'odwa gu vwiko vwi zinyumba ziavo ni vivala via vamenya mu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meshobabu, Jamuleki, Josia muyaayi wa Amazia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joeli, Jehu, muyaayi wa Joshibia, muyaayi wa Seraya, muyaayi wa Asieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elioenai, Jaakoba, Jeshohaya, Asaya, Adieli, Jesimieli, Benaja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ziza muyaayi wa Shifi, muyaayi wa Aloni, muyaayi wa Shemaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yava va mita gaavo gataliywi valange avanene mu vwiko vwi zinyumba ziavo, ni zinyumba zia vaguuga vaavo, ziamedeka ligali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Valanda kuduuka imadioli ahimbi na Gerari, kuzia ku lovega wi Ivugwi lwi livona, kuzia kwenya vwayiru vwa magondi gaavo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vanyoola vwayiru uvulahi, ni kivala chene yiki chaali kivambalalu ligali, chi lielemeriza, kandi chi mirembe; avandu avamenyaa mu kivala yiki maziambiri vaali vandu vi ihiiri ya Hamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ing'inga yu mwami Hezekia wi Ivuyuda, avandu vataliywi yavo, vazia Gedori ni vonogonyia amahema ga Avameuni avaari ni vamenyi yo ma vadivizwa ligali kali kuduuka lidiku lia lero. Maku vadikala yo no komenya mu vogono vwavo kigira haali ho nu vwayiru uvulahi ligali ku magondi gaavo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Valala ku avandu vi ihiiri ya Simioni ahimbi zimia zitano, vazia Ivugwi wa Edomu. Vimilirwa na vayaayi va Ishi: Pelatia, Nearia, Refaya na Uzieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku vita Avamaleki vahononoka likuza ma vamenya mu kivala yiki kutura lwene yilwo kuduuka lero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
